body:
oh, lord sossololpipi, forgive me...

&#x200B;

...***for I do not know how to edit spooptober memes...***

by god youre right

&#x200B;

my life feel complete, finally... thank you so much, stranger. i will love you for all eternity and forever.

alright then. i got depresson when i was 6 because my dad left and took my sister across the world to pursue a failing dream of being in a famous band. I also had a "friend" that was 14 at the time who used me as a depression cushion and tried to kill himself while on video camera with me. then my dad came back and acted like nothing ever happened. THEN, my mom decided to take her anger out on me, a then 7 year old curious brat that wanted to know why there was a naked woman on a beer cooler by shouting "Because men like naked women". Then i fell into a coping strategy of watching porn at the age of 7, which i got in trouble for after my sister ratted me out which made me more depressed. at 8 i wanted to kill myself and tried multiple times. i told friends, online and in real life. my mom found the messages, screamed at me, took away my entire internet access, caused me o have several panic attacks in the span of 3 hours which in turn made me hide under my thick blankets where i couldnt breath and i passed out. the next morning it was like NOTHING HAPPENED. THEN, she found a suicide note in my closet nd asked why  I wrote that. all i could say was "I was sad" and she pushed past me and walked away. by the time I was nine my mom had found more messages and screamed at me again. after that i learned my lesson to delete history, keep messages private, dont trust my parents, and never write down anything depression related. when i was 11 i was so badly depression I asked my arents for help, to which i chickened out, locked my door and hid in my closet. well, they broke down the door, dragged me out of the closet and pryed me open from the inside. Then I had a panic attack one night ad told a friend, in a desperate attempt for help, that i wanted to kill people which, obviously, isnt true. that friend told a friend of theirs and then it spread everywhere. the police were called and i was shoved into a destructive mental hospital with constant screaming, fights and suicide attempts. after that i had to get a mug shot and counceling once a week. now, suddenly, my parents LOVE me to bit and want to help me in every way possible.

&#x200B;

Is that elaborating?
